{"id":"en_conflit-de-parking","title":"Conflit de parking","titleEn":"Conflit de parking","description":"The husband of the wealthiest man’s daughter had just smiled and promised to maintain his luxury car for her, only to hand it over to his mistress on the spot. What makes it worse is that the mistress turns out to be his former university classmate. When the two women ran into each other in the underground parking lot of the alumni reunion, one was boasting about her “new” car while the other watched her own vehicle being handled by someone else. Old friendship collided with present-day hatred and love, and an unrestrained argument broke out at once.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/conflit-de-parking/fr_FR/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/conflit-de-parking/fr_FR/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Tit for Tat","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjmw2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_conflit-de-parking_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjmw2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_conflit-de-parking_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjmw2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_conflit-de-parking_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjmw2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_conflit-de-parking_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cjmw2/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"e